---
import LogoAvif from '@img/logoCompany.avif'
import LogoWebp from '@img/logoCompany.webp'
import LogoJpg from '@img/logoCompany.jpg'
import LogoPng from '@img/logoCompany.png'
import { CircleCheckBig, Globe, LaptopMinimalCheck, Megaphone, MessageCircleMore, ShieldCheck, TicketCheck, TrendingUp } from 'lucide-react'
---

<section class="py-16 lg:py-24 bg-neutral-50">
<div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
  <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16">
    <div class="flex-1 text-left space-y-8">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-100 border border-indigo-200 text-indigo-700 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span class="relative flex h-2 w-2">
          <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-indigo-500 opacity-75"></span>
          <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-indigo-500"></span>
        </span>
        Bono de Transformación Digital
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-5xl lg:text-7xl font-extrabold text-neutral-900 leading-[1.1] tracking-tight">
        No es un gasto.<br/>Es una <span class="text-indigo-600 underline decoration-indigo-300">inversión real</span> en tu marca.
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg lg:text-xl text-neutral-600 max-w-xl leading-relaxed">
        Transforma tu presencia digital hoy. Olvida los precios excesivos y obtén un ecosistema profesional optimizado para vender.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center gap-6">
        <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=573217028011&text=Hola%2C%20quiero%20m%C3%A1s%20informaci%C3%B3n" target="_blank" class="bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-500 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-xl font-extrabold text-lg transition-all shadow-lg shadow-indigo-600/25 flex items-center gap-2">
          ¡Aprovechar Oferta!
          <MessageCircleMore />
        </a>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <span class="text-neutral-400 line-through text-lg font-medium">$1.399.000 COP</span>
          <span class="text-2xl font-black text-neutral-900">$599.000 COP</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-1 w-full relative">
      <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-indigo-100 rounded-3xl blur-3xl opacity-30"></div>
      <div class="relative bg-white border border-neutral-200 rounded-2xl shadow-2xl overflow-hidden aspect-video group">
        <div class="w-full h-full bg-center bg-cover transition-transform duration-700 group-hover:scale-105" style='background-image: url("https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAh6-GFoUvZFG1j0U-HyLyOKwAVe3strwhZ7Z3CaEEWAzdxu44v48cgFlsEgU9Ow4cpNWEZ0fl-6tiGGAkhmf4uSZz-sjCAI2qd-R6mFFXLRNfe6EOXwmbBs97qcWo_3GCTaEvJykkhostQsD2YWt71p31McJd100E5R4RZ-BMo0HGQiUhg4IU-R8RHH8btZsx3jA_LZkDn4YiCxxieCB8NFJUvmFtH477DV5kzQpZqywQYM7nBOC3SCJKdL8fG_WJowjKuFkcZpW0");'>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="absolute -bottom-6 -left-6 bg-white p-4 rounded-xl shadow-xl flex items-center gap-4 border border-neutral-100 max-w-xs">
        <div class="size-10 rounded-full bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600">
          <ShieldCheck />
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs font-bold leading-tight">Resultados Garantizados de 1 a 3 meses.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="py-12 bg-white" id="stats">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl p-8 border-2 border-neutral-100 bg-neutral-50">
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
          <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Precio Mercado</p>
          <TrendingUp />
        </div>
        <p class="text-neutral-400 tracking-tight text-4xl font-extrabold line-through leading-none">$1.399.000 COP</p>
        <p class="text-neutral-500 text-sm font-medium italic">Incluye hosting y diseño básico.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col gap-4 rounded-2xl p-8 border-4 border-indigo-200 bg-indigo-50 relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-1 font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-tighter text-white rounded-bl-lg">OFERTA LIMITADA</div>
        <div class="flex justify-between items-center">
          <p class="text-neutral-900 text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest">Inversión Especial</p>
          <TicketCheck />
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-baseline gap-4">
          <p class="text-neutral-900 tracking-tight text-5xl font-black leading-none">$599.000 COP</p>
          <p class="text-red-500 text-xl font-black bg-red-50 px-2 py-1 rounded-lg">-57% OFF</p>
        </div>
        <p class="text-neutral-600 text-sm font-semibold">Paquete completo + Estrategia de pauta incluida.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="py-24 bg-neutral-50" id="bundle">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="text-center mb-20 space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-indigo-600 font-black uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-sm">¿Qué incluye el bono?</h2>
      <h3 class="text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-black text-neutral-900 tracking-tight">Todo lo que necesitas para despegar.</h3>
      <p class="text-neutral-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto text-lg">
        Sin cargos ocultos. Un diseño premium y una estrategia de tráfico real para que tu negocio empiece a facturar.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      <div class="group flex flex-col gap-6 p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm border border-neutral-100 transition-all hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-indigo-600/10 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="size-14 rounded-xl bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-600 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">
          <LaptopMinimalCheck />
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Diseño Web Profesional</h4>
          <p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">
            Sitios limpios, rápidos y optimizados para convertir visitantes en clientes reales. 100% Mobile Ready.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 mt-auto border-t border-neutral-50">
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-tighter">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CircleCheckBig /> UX/UI Premium</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CircleCheckBig /> SEO On-page</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="group flex flex-col gap-6 p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm border border-neutral-100 transition-all hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-indigo-600/10 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="size-14 rounded-xl bg-indigo-100 flex items-center justify-center text-indigo-600 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">
          <Globe />
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">.com Dominio Incluido</h4>
          <p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">
            Asegura tu nombre en la web por 1 año y construye autoridad de marca desde el primer día con correos corporativos.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 mt-auto border-t border-neutral-50">
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-tighter">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CircleCheckBig /> Certificado SSL</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CircleCheckBig /> WhoIs Privacy</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="group flex flex-col gap-6 p-8 rounded-2xl bg-white shadow-sm border border-neutral-100 transition-all hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-indigo-600/10 hover:-translate-y-1">
        <div class="size-14 rounded-xl bg-emerald-100 flex items-center justify-center text-emerald-600 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110">
          <Megaphone />
        </div>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <h4 class="text-xl font-bold text-neutral-900">Estrategia de Publicidad</h4>
          <p class="text-neutral-600 leading-relaxed text-sm">
            Configuración de campañas en Google & Meta Ads para atraer tráfico calificado. Empezamos a atraer clientes de inmediato.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="pt-4 mt-auto border-t border-neutral-50">
          <ul class="space-y-2 text-xs font-bold text-neutral-500 uppercase tracking-tighter">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CircleCheckBig /> Google Search Ads</li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><CircleCheckBig /> Meta Business</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="py-20">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-12">
    <div class="relative bg-indigo-600 rounded-3xl p-12 lg:p-20 overflow-hidden shadow-2xl shadow-indigo-600/20">
      <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-white/10 rounded-full -mr-32 -mt-32 blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-64 h-64 bg-neutral-900/10 rounded-full -ml-32 -mb-32 blur-3xl"></div>
      <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center space-y-8">
        <h2 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white tracking-tighter max-w-3xl leading-tight">
          ¡Transforma tu negocio hoy mismo!
        </h2>
        <p class="text-white/80 text-lg lg:text-xl font-medium max-w-2xl">
          Haz clic para contactarnos directamente por WhatsApp. Estamos listos para llevar tu marca al siguiente nivel.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
          <a href="https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=573217028011&text=Hola%2C%20quiero%20m%C3%A1s%20informaci%C3%B3n" target="_blank" class="bg-white hover:bg-neutral-100 text-indigo-600 px-10 py-5 rounded-2xl font-black text-xl transition-all flex items-center gap-3 shadow-xl">
            <MessageCircleMore/>
            Contactar por WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
</section>
